{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Bomber Hero",
    "steam_appid": 3053490,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053490/extras/05c5f3c79a66c428af38d3553eec7416.avif?t=1737490229\" width=616 height=352 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>bomber Hero</strong></h2></h2><br>Bomber Hero is a dynamic bomberman-style game that will provide you with hours of great fun! The game offers various gameplay modes, the ability to create unique characters, and many different maps to explore.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>character Creation:</strong></h2></h2>Create your hero by choosing from many customization options. Adjust your character's appearance to perfectly match your playstyle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>equipment:</strong></h2></h2>Bomber Hero offers a wide selection of Steam-exclusive equipment that is purely cosmetic. Change the appearance of your character with unique items that do not affect the game mechanics.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>maps:</strong></h2></h2>Explore various maps, each with a unique layout, obstacles, and challenges. Besides classic mazes, you will also find arenas with teleporters that add a new dimension to the gameplay.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>online Play:</strong></h2></h2>Play online with friends by creating your own rooms - lobbies where you can compete or cooperate. You can also add bots to diversify the gameplay and increase the challenge.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053490/extras/4f05ee2d3d05f7231ec145962eabdaf4.avif?t=1737490229\" width=600 height=900 /></span><br><br>Join the Bomber Hero community and start your adventure today! Get ready for an explosive fun!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053490/extras/05c5f3c79a66c428af38d3553eec7416.avif?t=1737490229\" width=616 height=352 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>bomber Hero</strong></h2></h2><br>Bomber Hero is a dynamic bomberman-style game that will provide you with hours of great fun! The game offers various gameplay modes, the ability to create unique characters, and many different maps to explore.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>character Creation:</strong></h2></h2>Create your hero by choosing from many customization options. Adjust your character's appearance to perfectly match your playstyle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>equipment:</strong></h2></h2>Bomber Hero offers a wide selection of Steam-exclusive equipment that is purely cosmetic. Change the appearance of your character with unique items that do not affect the game mechanics.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>maps:</strong></h2></h2>Explore various maps, each with a unique layout, obstacles, and challenges. Besides classic mazes, you will also find arenas with teleporters that add a new dimension to the gameplay.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>online Play:</strong></h2></h2>Play online with friends by creating your own rooms - lobbies where you can compete or cooperate. You can also add bots to diversify the gameplay and increase the challenge.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053490/extras/4f05ee2d3d05f7231ec145962eabdaf4.avif?t=1737490229\" width=600 height=900 /></span><br><br>Join the Bomber Hero community and start your adventure today! Get ready for an explosive fun!",
    "short_description": "BomberHero is a thrilling multiplayer game inspired by Bomberman. Up to 4 players can join online battles or play against bots. Customize your hero, collect power-ups, and dominate diverse arenas. Are you ready for explosive fun? Join the action on Steam!",
